00:07:16.840 --> 00:07:20.280
Is there something you've done multiple times or could do multiple times,

165
00:07:20.280 --> 00:07:22.600
such that if you do this set of actions,

166
00:07:22.600 --> 00:07:27.320
you get a specific deliverable that the client or your company or your customer

167
00:07:27.320 --> 00:07:27.760
gets.

168
00:07:27.760 --> 00:07:30.120
The more specific that you can do it, the better.

