00:07:42.880 --> 00:07:46.560
And just two final points regarding this topic that I think will help you out.

174
00:07:46.560 --> 00:07:50.070
The first one is that you should always try and reuse components as much as you

175
00:07:50.070 --> 00:07:50.400
can.

