223
00:09:48.600 --> 00:09:49.960
And so that is the shift.

224
00:09:49.960 --> 00:09:52.880
If you want more leverage and if you want to expand further,

225
00:09:52.880 --> 00:09:55.440
then you need to start thinking about going from custom work

226
00:09:55.520 --> 00:09:57.040
to productized packages.

227
00:09:57.040 --> 00:10:00.120
It is much easier to sell to price and to deliver.

